# Transient-/etc test variant only: record writes to /etc for
# tests/transient-etc-report.py. Fedora's audit.rules ends with
# -a task,never, which stops syscall records for every process forked after
# it; continue past a missing rule so the watch is still installed.
# auditctl requires -R FILE to be the only command-line arguments.
-c
-d task,never
-w /etc -p wa -k atomic-linux-etc
